"start":{"line":74,"column":43,"offset":3010},"end":{"line":74,"column":55,"offset":3022}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":74,"column":1,"offset":2968},"end":{"line":74,"column":55,"offset":3022}}},{"type":"code","lang":"sbpf","meta":null,"value":"call 16   ; Call sol_log_ (helper ID 16)\r\nexit      ; Return using r0 value","position":{"start":{"line":76,"column":1,"offset":3026},"end":{"line":79,"column":4,"offset":3115}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-4"}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Kesimpulan","position":{"start":{"line":81,"column":17,"offset":3135},"end":{"line":81,"column":34,"offset":3152}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"conclusion","position":{"start":{"line":81,"column":35,"offset":3153},"end":{"line":81,"column":50,"offset":3168}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":81,"column":51,"offset":3169},"end":{"line":81,"column":61,"offset":3179}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":81,"column":1,"offset":3119},"end":{"line":81,"column":64,"offset":3182}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Program ini:","position":{"start":{"line":83,"column":1,"offset":3186},"end":{"line":83,"column":13,"offset":3198}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":83,"column":1,"offset":3186},"end":{"line":83,"column":13,"offset":3198}}},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Memanggil 16 (","position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":4,"offset":3203},"end":{"line":84,"column":18,"offset":3217}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sol_log_","position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":18,"offset":3217},"end":{"line":84,"column":28,"offset":3227}}},{"type":"text","value":") untuk mencetak memo ke log validator","position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":28,"offset":3227},"end":{"line":84,"column":66,"offset":3265}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":4,"offset":3203},"end":{"line":84,"column":66,"offset":3265}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":1,"offset":3200},"end":{"line":84,"column":66,"offset":3265}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Keluar menggunakan nilai dalam ","position":{"start":{"line":85,"column":4,"offset":3270},"end":{"line":85,"column":35,"offset":3301}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"r0","position":{"start":{"line":85,"column":35,"offset":3301},"end":{"line":85,"column":39,"offset":3305}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":85,"column":4,"offset":3270},"end":{"line":85,"column":39,"offset":3305}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":85,"column":1,"offset":3267},"end":{"line":85,"column":39,"offset":3305}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":1,"offset":3200},"end":{"line":85,"column":39,"offset":3305}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":85,"column":39,"offset":3305}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n![Assembly Memo Challenge](/graphics/challenge-banners/assembly-memo.png)\r\n\r\n# Assembly Memo\r\n\r\nDalam unit ini kita akan menggunakan sBPF Assembly untuk membuat mekanisme pencatatan untuk program kita.\r\n\r\nKesederhanaan program memo berukuran kecil adalah titik awal yang sempurna untuk perjalanan sBPF assembly Anda!\r\n\r\nJika Anda belum terbiasa dengan pemrograman assembly, ikuti [kursus pengantar Assembly](/id/courses/introduction-to-assembly)\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Program Design\" id=\"program-design\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nProgram kita akan menempatkan lokasi memori yang tepat ke dalam register yang tepat dan kemudian melakukan syscall `sol_log_`. Ini akan terlihat seperti ini:\r\n\r\n```sbpf\r\n.equ NUM_ACCOUNTS, 0x00\r\n.equ DATA_LEN, 0x08\r\n.equ DATA, 0x10\r\n.globl entrypoint\r\nentrypoint:\r\n  ldxdw r0, [r1+NUM_ACCOUNTS]\r\n  ldxdw r2, [r1+DATA_LEN]\r\n  add64 r1, DATA\r\n  call sol_log_\r\n  exit\r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Memory Offsets\" id=\"memory-offsets\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nProgram dimulai dengan mendeklarasikan tiga konstanta `.equ` yang mendefinisikan tata letak memori dari data instruksi kita:\r\n\r\n```sbpf\r\n.equ NUM_ACCOUNTS, 0x00  ; Offset for number of accounts\r\n.equ DATA_LEN, 0x08      ; Offset for data length\r\n.equ DATA, 0x10          ; Offset for actual data\r\n```\r\n\r\nKonstanta-konstanta ini menandai byte-offset relatif terhadap pointer entry-buffer di `r1`:\r\n- `NUM_ACCOUNTS` (0x0000): Menunjuk ke jumlah akun dalam header data instruksi untuk validasi\r\n- `DATA_LEN` (0x08): Menunjuk ke panjang data instruksi dalam header data instruksi\r\n- `DATA` (0x10): Menunjuk ke data instruksi dalam header data instruksi\r\n\r\nTidak seperti bahasa tingkat tinggi yang mengabstraksi tata letak memori, assembly mengharuskan kita mengetahui persis di mana setiap bagian data berada.\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Entrypoint and Initial Validation\" id=\"entrypoint-and-validations\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n```sbpf\r\n.globl entrypoint\r\nentrypoint:\r\n  ldxdw r0, [r1+NUM_ACCOUNTS]   ; Load number of accounts into r0\r\n```\r\n\r\nSetiap program sBPF dimulai pada simbol global `.entrypoint`. Runtime Solana menyediakan data akun dan instruksi melalui register `r1`.\r\n\r\nInstruksi pertama ini kemudian memuat jumlah akun ke dalam `r0`. Karena `r0` adalah register yang dibaca VM saat keluar, ini memiliki dua tujuan:\r\n1. Memuat jumlah akun untuk penggunaan kita\r\n2. Memastikan program akan gagal secara otomatis jika ada akun yang diteruskan (nilai bukan nol di r0)\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Sol Log Syscall\" id=\"sol-log-syscall\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nSelanjutnya, kita menyiapkan argumen untuk syscall `sol_log_`:\r\n\r\n```sbpf\r\nldxdw r2, [r1+DATA_LEN]   ; Load length of memo into r2\r\nadd64  r1, DATA           ; Adjust r1 to point to memo bytes\r\n```\r\n\r\nInstruksi-instruksi ini menyiapkan argumen untuk `sol_log_`:\r\n- `r2` menerima panjang data memo\r\n- `r1` disesuaikan untuk menunjuk langsung ke byte-byte memo\r\n\r\nDan setelah itu, kita memanggil `sol_log_` dan keluar:\r\n\r\n```sbpf\r\ncall 16   ; Call sol_log_ (helper ID 16)\r\nexit      ; Return using r0 value\r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Kesimpulan\" id=\"conclusion\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nProgram ini:\r\n1. Memanggil 16 (`sol_log_`) untuk mencetak memo ke log validator\r\n2. Keluar menggunakan nilai dalam `r0`","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"sbpf","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":".equ NUM_ACCOUNTS, "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F1FA8C"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"0x00"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":".equ DATA_LEN, "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F1FA8C"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"0x08"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":".equ DATA, "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F1FA8C"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"0x10"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"elemen